# There are no secrets in this project, and that is deliberate.
#
# The ingest needs no API keys: Yahoo Finance and Wikipedia are both unauthenticated.
# The frontend is a static site that reads committed JSON. Nothing here needs to be
# set for the app to run -- this file exists to document that fact rather than to
# leave you hunting for credentials that do not exist.

# Where the frontend fetches the data artifacts from. Defaults to /data, served
# from the same origin. Only change this if you host the JSON somewhere else.
VITE_DATA_BASE_URL=/data
